# Public-share hygiene (added 2026-06-09)
# Copyrighted papers — keep the .md docling transcriptions, never the PDFs
references/*.pdf
# Personal / external paths — must never enter a public repo
application/artifacts_arm_a
application/data/
data/external/*.csv
data/external/*.parquet
